graph TD
    A[User sends message] --> B{classify_message<br/>rule-based, no LLM}

    B -->|STYLE| C[cache_lookup<br/>skip cache]
    B -->|FOLLOW-UP| C
    B -->|STANDALONE| C

    C -->|STYLE: always skip| G[generate<br/>restyle previous answer]
    C -->|FOLLOW-UP: contextual exact match only| D{Cache Hit?}
    C -->|STANDALONE: exact → semantic → guards| D

    D -->|HIT| K[finalize<br/>return cached answer]
    D -->|MISS + FOLLOW-UP| E[rewrite_question<br/>LLM: standalone form]
    D -->|MISS + STANDALONE| F[retrieve<br/>FAISS book index, top 4]

    E --> F

    F --> H{scope_check<br/>best score ≥ threshold?}
    H -->|No| I[Polite decline<br/>no LLM call]
    H -->|Yes| J[generate<br/>LLM answers from context]

    J --> L[validate<br/>check citations]
    I --> L
    G --> L

    L --> M{maybe_store<br/>cache policy check}
    M -->|Cacheable| N[Store in SQLite + FAISS]
    M -->|Not cacheable| K
    N --> K

    K --> O[Return response<br/>reply, citations, cache_hit, latency_ms]

    style A fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style D fill:#ff9800,color:#fff
    style K fill:#4caf50,color:#fff
    style O fill:#4caf50,color:#fff
    style I fill:#f44336,color:#fff
